flowchart TB
  Client[Customer: voice / web / messaging] --> API[FastAPI application]
  API --> Auth[Identity, RBAC, tenant and branch scope]
  API --> Scheduler[Availability and appointment lifecycle]
  API --> CRM[Customer profiles, consent, preferences and history]
  API --> Notify[Email outbox and notification adapter]
  API --> LLM[LLM provider interface]
  LLM --> Ollama[Ollama local model]
  Scheduler --> DB[(PostgreSQL + FORCE RLS)]
  CRM --> DB
  Notify --> DB
  Notify --> Mailpit[Mailpit local SMTP]
  API --> Redis[(Redis rate limiter)]
  API --> Audit[Append-only audit log]
  Audit --> DB
